sequenceDiagram
    participant Client A
    participant Client B
    participant Node 1
    participant Node 2
    participant Redis
    participant Router as Real-Time Router
    
    Client A->>Node 1: SSE Connect (Project X)
    Node 1->>Redis: SADD route:project:X "Node 1"
    
    Client B->>Node 2: SSE Connect (Project Y)
    Node 2->>Redis: SADD route:project:Y "Node 2"
    
    Note over Router: Kafka Event: Project X Updated
    Router->>Redis: SMEMBERS route:project:X
    Redis-->>Router: ["Node 1"]
    
    Router->>Redis: PUBLISH instance:Node 1 (Payload)
    Redis-->>Node 1: Receives PubSub message
    Node 1->>Client A: Pushes SSE Payload
    
    Note over Client B, Node 2: Zero traffic routed to Node 2.<br/>Zero Fan-Out Achieved.
